@startuml olivaris-backend-class-diagram
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members

title olivaris-app - esquema esencial

package "olivaris-app" {
  package controllers {
    class AuthController <<RestController>>
    class PlotController <<RestController>>
    class UserController <<RestController>>
    class EntityController <<RestController>>
    class ActivityController <<RestController>>
    class ErrorResponseHandler <<RestControllerAdvice>>
  }

  package services {
    interface AuthService
    interface PlotService
    interface UserService
    interface EntityService
    interface ActivityService
    interface JwtService
    interface EnclosureService
    interface PhytoProductService
    class CustomUserDetailsService
  }

  package repositories {
    interface UserRepository
    interface PlotRepository
    interface EntityRepository
    interface ActivityRepository
    interface EnclosureRepository
    interface UserPlotRepository
    interface UserEntityRoleRepository
    interface RoleRepository
    interface EntityRoleRepository
    interface PhytoProductRepository
    interface PhytoActRepository
  }

  package security {
    class SecurityConfig <<Configuration>>
    class JwtAuthFilter <<Component>>
  }

  package clients {
    class SigpacApiClient <<Component>>
  }

  package config {
    class WebClientConfig <<Configuration>>
    class AppConfig <<Configuration>>
  }

  package models {
    class User <<entity>>
    class Role <<entity>>
    class Plot <<entity>>
    class Enclosure <<entity>>
    class EnabledEntity <<entity>>
    class Activity <<entity>>
    class PhytoProduct <<entity>>
    class PhytoAct <<entity>>
  }
}

' capa web
AuthController --> AuthService
PlotController --> PlotService
UserController --> UserService
EntityController --> EntityService
ActivityController --> ActivityService
ErrorResponseHandler ..> AuthController : errores

' servicios principales
CustomUserDetailsService --> UserRepository
SecurityConfig --> JwtAuthFilter
JwtAuthFilter --> JwtService
JwtAuthFilter --> UserRepository
WebClientConfig --> SigpacApiClient
SigpacApiClient --> Plot

' dominio principal
User "1" --> "0..*" Activity
User "*" --> "*" Role
Plot "1" --> "0..*" Enclosure
Enclosure "1" --> "0..*" Activity
Activity "1" --> "0..*" PhytoAct
Activity "0..1" --> "1" EnabledEntity
PhytoProduct "1" --> "0..*" PhytoAct

note right of User
Las relaciones N:M de usuario-parcela y usuario-entidad se materializan con tablas puente
(UserPlot y UserEntityRole), que no se muestran para mantener el diagrama limpio.
end note

note bottom
Se omiten DTOs, excepciones, validadores e implementaciones concretas para priorizar la arquitectura esencial.
end note

@enduml